# Hardened: public-key authentication only, no root login, verbose auth logging.
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
MaxAuthTries 3
LogLevel VERBOSE
X11Forwarding no
UsePAM yes
Subsystem sftp /usr/lib/openssh/sftp-server
